'''Pumpkin Doge''' (わんぷきん, ''Wampkin'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

